ed (topped early) \u2014 a bearish structural tell.", "next": "Don't initiate here. Wait for a pullback toward the 10-day average \u2014 or the next daily-cycle low to set up \u2014 for a lower-risk entry; hold if you're already long.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "neutral", "regime_label": "MIXED", "regime_why": "weekly momentum positive; last cycle left-translated (topped early)", "regime_score": 0.5, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: MIXED \u2014 weekly momentum positive; last cycle left-translated (topped early) (investor cycle week 12 \u00b7 daily cycle day 49).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): nearing a high. Bigger picture (no clear trend): mixed.", "synthesis_line": "", "synthesis_line_zh": "", "points": ["Bigger picture is mixed (no clear trend for a daily long)", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average, and it's turning up", "Prior cycle topped early (a tiring-trend hint)"], "entry": {"tag": "DON'T CHASE", "tag_zh": "\u52ff\u8ffd\u9ad8", "urgency": "caution", "text": "You missed the bottoming entry \u2014 the low already formed and price is now extended (momentum is fading \u2014 the daily momentum is already rolling over). Don't chase; wait for a pullback to the 10-day average or the next cycle low. Hold if already long.", "text_zh": "\u5df2\u9519\u8fc7\u7b51\u5e95\u5165\u573a\u2014\u2014\u4f4e\u70b9\u5df2\u7ecf\u5f62\u6210\uff0c\u76ee\u524d\u4ef7\u683c\u5df2\u62c9\u4f38\uff08\u52a8\u91cf\u6b63\u5728\u8870\u7aed\u2014\u2014\u65e5\u7ebf\u52a8\u91cf\u5df2\u5f00\u59cb\u6389\u5934\u5411\u4e0b\uff09\u3002\u4e0d\u8981\u8ffd\u9ad8\uff1b\u7b49\u5f85\u56de\u8c03\u81f3 10 \u65e5\u5747\u7ebf\u6216\u4e0b\u4e00\u4e2a\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9\u3002\u82e5\u5df2\u6301\u6709\u5219\u7ee7\u7eed\u6301\u6709\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 49 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "overdue \u2014 past the typical window, so a low could form any day", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\u